WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
One round, from the parking lot to settled up.
Mike, Jess, Sarah and Tom at Tetherow. Team Nassau, skins and closest to the pin.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Set the round.
Course and tees, three guests and their handicaps, two teams, three games, the amounts.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.600
Strokes, handed out.
Full course handicaps — 9, 13, 17 and 26 — dotted on the holes where they land.

4
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:54.200
Tap a number. Next tee.
GoLo takes each team’s better net ball. Net 3 against net 3 on the 3rd, so the skin carries over.

5
00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:06.200
Front nine’s in the books.
Holes 4–9 cut for time. Jess &amp; Sarah took the front 3&amp;2 and a five-skin 6th; the back nine and the overall match are still live.

6
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:18.800
The math is already done.
Holes 10–17 cut for time. Mike &amp; Tom take the back 4&amp;2 and the overall 3&amp;1.

7
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.600
One number per player.
Three games netted into one short settle-up list: Sarah owes Tom $19, Jess owes Mike $11.

8
00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.500
GoLo keeps the tally.
Settle up outside the app, however your group does, then tick Mark settled. GoLo never moves or sees the money.
